"•Shweta Khajuria Analyst, Wolfe Research LLC Q Thanks a lot for taking my questions. There are two on Delivery please. Dara, could you please talk about your affordability efforts? In your letter, you talked to four key areas, and affordability was one of them. So if you could please expand on that, that would be great.\\n",
