"•Prashanth Mahendra-Rajah Chief Financial Officer, Uber Technologies, Inc. A I will. Thanks, Dara. I think, Brian, your question was on Mobility growth. So maybe I'll start with just restating how we did for Q2 and our outlook for Q3. So for Q2, the results that we printed, if you do it at a constant currency, very strong at 27% year-over-year growth.\\n",
