"•Dara Khosrowshahi Chief Executive Officer & Director, Uber Technologies, Inc. A Yeah, Justin. In terms of a consumer downturn scenario on Mobility, we see these circumstances in a number of markets. LatAm has been through a bunch of cyclical trends, et cetera. And usually, a downturn – kind of the leading indicator of a downturn is a weak job market.\\n",
