"•Kyle Voigt: Hi, good morning. Maybe just a follow-up on the Vanguard/Wellington partnership. Vanguard obviously has a substantial presence in the 401k channel. So really just wanted to get your updated thoughts on how close the 401k opportunity could be? And with this partnership announced, how do you feel about Blackstone’s current positioning to capitalize on that opportunity?\\n",
