"•Prashanth Mahendra-Rajah Chief Financial Officer, Uber Technologies, Inc. A Sure. So I think the question – your question, John, again, was on merchant-funded offers, how are we – or on offers in general, how are we seeing that in – on an impact for the business? So I would tell you to think about it in two elements.\\n",
